/P 707 0 R
/T (Teams must optimize the pipeline for real-time throughput, streaming fixed-point operation, low latency, minimum logic utilization, and low power while maintaining structural modularity and robust testability.)
/E (Teams must optimize the pipeline for real-time throughput, streaming fixed-point operation, low latency, minimum logic utilization, and low power while maintaining structural modularity and robust testability.)
