/Title (The goal of this project is to design, implement, and verify a real-time, hardware-efficient, all-digital baseband synchronization subsystem on an FPGA/ASIC platform. Targeted for burst-mode wireless receivers \(e.g., 5G NR, Wi-Fi 6/7, satellite communications\), the subsystem accepts oversampled baseband I/Q samples, corrects symbol timing errors, estimates coarse carrier frequency offset \(CFO\), and performs joint fine CFO and phase tracking for QPSK and 16-QAM constellations.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1098 0 R
/Next 1270 0 R
>>
endobj
